  "name": "binius",
  "description": "Binius is a high-performance Rust library implementing a cryptographic SNARK optimized for towers of binary fields. It provides a comprehensive framework for constructing multilinear polynomial interactive oracle proofs (PIOPs), featuring optimized implementations of the sumcheck protocol, FRI-based polynomial commitments, and Lasso lookup arguments. The system leverages hardware-level acceleration, including SIMD and GFNI instructions, to achieve high-throughput proving for large-scale circuit constraints.",
